WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.064
My master wanted to get as much money as he could from showing me.

2
00:00:18.065 --> 00:00:24.070
He decided to take me and Glumdalclitch to the capital of Brobdingnag.

3
00:00:24.071 --> 00:00:27.430
"We'll stop at every town along the way,"

4
00:00:27.431 --> 00:00:30.055
I heard him say to his wife.

5
00:00:30.056 --> 00:00:34.057
He was greedy, and I had begun to dislike him.

6
00:00:34.058 --> 00:00:38.468
One August morning, we set off for the capital city.

7
00:00:38.469 --> 00:00:47.391
We stopped often, and Glumdalclitch took me out of my traveling box to let me stretch and see the countryside.

8
00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:55.521
Our trip lasted ten weeks, and I performed in 18 large towns and many villages.

9
00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:58.642
Finally, we reached the capital.

10
00:00:58.643 --> 00:01:07.453
Again my master rented a meeting room in a hotel and made me perform at least ten times every day.

11
00:01:07.454 --> 00:01:09.666
Crowds lined up to see me.

12
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:16.013
As the weeks passed I became more and more exhausted and lost a lot of weight.

13
00:01:16.014 --> 00:01:21.757
I looked so terrible that my master began to think that I would die soon.

14
00:01:21.758 --> 00:01:26.552
"I might as well get rid of you," he said unkindly.

15
00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:30.237
"You will be no use to me when you are dead."

16
00:01:30.238 --> 00:01:34.663
One day, a messenger arrived from the palace nearby.

17
00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:40.495
"You are ordered to come to the palace with your creature," said the messenger to my master.

18
00:01:40.496 --> 00:01:44.096
"The queen and her ladies want to be entertained."

19
00:01:44.097 --> 00:01:46.968
We went to the palace immediately.

20
00:01:46.969 --> 00:01:52.122
A servant showed us into the room where the queen and her ladies were waiting.

21
00:01:52.123 --> 00:01:57.877
I kneeled down in front of the queen, and asked for the honor of kissing her foot.

22
00:01:57.878 --> 00:02:02.304
Instead, the queen held out her little finger to me.

23
00:02:02.305 --> 00:02:06.364
"You may kiss my finger," she said.

24
00:02:06.365 --> 00:02:10.081
I bowed, kissed her finger, and said,

25
00:02:10.082 --> 00:02:13.774
"It is a great honor to meet you, Your Majesty."

26
00:02:13.775 --> 00:02:19.139
"Tell me about your country and your travels," she said.

27
00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:25.725
She showed great interest as I talked, and then she asked me a surprising question:

28
00:02:25.726 --> 00:02:30.295
"Would you like to live here in the palace?"

29
00:02:30.296 --> 00:02:32.792
I bowed again and replied,

30
00:02:32.793 --> 00:02:35.253
"That is not for me to decide.

31
00:02:35.254 --> 00:02:37.493
I must serve my master."

32
00:02:37.494 --> 00:02:42.566
"Will you sell your creature?" she asked my master.

33
00:02:42.567 --> 00:02:50.485
Since he thought I was dying anyway, he was happy to accept a thousand pieces of gold in exchange for me.

34
00:02:50.486 --> 00:02:58.367
"Your Majesty," I said politely to the queen, "Glumdalclitch looks after me and teaches me well.

35
00:02:58.368 --> 00:03:00.418
Could she stay here too?"

36
00:03:00.419 --> 00:03:05.040
"Will you allow this, farmer?" the queen asked my master.

37
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:09.018
"She may stay if she wants to," he replied.

38
00:03:09.019 --> 00:03:12.181
Glumdalclitch could hardly hide her joy.

39
00:03:12.182 --> 00:03:15.376
My master said good-bye to me and his daughter.

40
00:03:15.377 --> 00:03:18.770
As he was leaving, I bowed to him slightly.

41
00:03:18.771 --> 00:03:23.649
"You seem cold toward your master," the queen observed.

42
00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.347
"Tell me why."

43
00:03:25.348 --> 00:03:31.765
With some hesitation, I said, "Your Majesty, he has worked me hard."

44
00:03:31.766 --> 00:03:37.436
And I explained what my master had made me do so that he could get rich.

45
00:03:37.437 --> 00:03:42.233
My story interested her, and she carried me to see the king.

46
00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:45.678
He seemed a serious and intelligent man.

47
00:03:45.679 --> 00:03:49.614
At first he thought I might be some sort of machine.

48
00:03:49.615 --> 00:03:54.167
He did not believe that someone of my size could be human.

49
00:03:54.168 --> 00:03:59.418
When I began to speak, however, the king could not hide his amazement.

50
00:03:59.419 --> 00:04:05.156
The queen asked me to tell my story all over again.

51
00:04:05.157 --> 00:04:10.545
The king was so impressed that he sent for his three best scholars.

52
00:04:10.546 --> 00:04:15.139
They asked me many questions and discussed my answers at length.

53
00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:18.552
They decided that I could not be a human.

54
00:04:18.553 --> 00:04:25.797
"There are millions of people my size in England," I explained, "but no one of your size."

55
00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:29.249
The scholars just smiled in disbelief.

56
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:34.224
After they left, the king asked me and Glumdalclitch many questions.

57
00:04:34.225 --> 00:04:41.969
Finally, he decided that my story must be true.
